R1-Omni/models
R1-Omni/**/__pycache__
UI_API/frontend/node_modules
UI_API/learning_data
# The retired-settings-key gate reads the stored settings document. Excluding
# the whole directory made that gate fail inside docker/scripts/test.sh while
# passing in CI, where pytest runs against a checkout. Only the test stage
# copies it back in; runtime images still carry no settings document.
!UI_API/learning_data/settings.json
UI_API/runtime_data
# `tools/` is not application code, but the contract-drift gate runs the
# OpenAPI type generator from inside the test image, so it has to be in the
# build context. Only the test stage copies it; runtime images do not.
tools/architecture_inventory*
tools/demo_*
tools/import_*
